{{/*
  Rendered into every page's <head> (Forgejo's custom/header hook), whatever
  theme the account has picked, which is why this is here and not in the
  LosOS theme CSS: an account created before the LosOS theme keeps its old
  theme, and it should still not be sent to forgejo.org.

  The navbar's Help entries (one for visitors, one in the signed-in user
  menu) are hard-coded to forgejo.org/docs in base/head_navbar.tmpl, with no
  setting to turn them off, and overriding that whole template to drop two
  links would pin all of the navbar to one Forgejo release. Hiding them
  costs one rule.
*/}}
<style>
	#navbar a[href^="https://forgejo.org/"],
	#navbar li:has(> a[href^="https://forgejo.org/"]) { display: none; }
</style>
